# This directory is the PUBLIC GitHub Pages repo. Only sanitized reports belong here:
#   index.html, reports/<slug>/report.html, reports/<slug>/report.pdf, reports/<slug>/meta.json
#
# The rules below are a defensive guard: even if a raw artifact is ever copied in by
# mistake, it will never be committed/published.

# Secrets - must never appear here
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem

# Raw run artifacts (contain response bodies, tokens, internal IPs) - never publish
*.csv
*.log
api_calls*
ui_timings*
endpoints*
selectors*
summary*.csv

# Local/dev noise
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
_*.png
